abstract: >-
  Decoupled T5Gemma-2-270M System-1 decision engine: state-only encoder cache
  plus parallel non-autoregressive slot decoder with per-primitive temperature
  calibration, evaluated on the typed-decisions benchmark (Gate 1, CUDA).
